{"id":"e_tant","lemma":"étant","pos":"noun","rank":977,"glosses":["being"],"ipa":"/e.tɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/93/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-%C3%A9tant.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-%C3%A9tant.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"étants"},"examples":[{"text":"Étant fatigué il est allé au lit.","en":"Since he was tired, he went to bed.","words":[null,{"g":"tired"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"to bed! off to bed!…"]]},{"text":"Personne ne danse en étant sobre.","en":"No one dances sober.","words":[{"g":"no one, nobody"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"dance"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,{"g":"sober"}]},{"text":"Étant très fatigué, je m'endormis bientôt.","en":"Being very tired, I soon fell asleep.","words":[null,{"g":"very"},{"g":"tired"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"asleep","l":"endormi"},{"g":"soon"}]},{"text":"Étant donné son inexpérience, elle a bien fait.","en":"Given her inexperience, she has done well.","words":[null,{"g":"to give","l":"donner"},{"g":"his, her, its"},null,{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"An exclamation that a…"]]},{"text":"Elle l'a décrit comme étant beau.","en":"She described him as handsome.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to describe","l":"décrire"},{"g":"as"},null,{"g":"handsome"}]}]}